01:25:37.630 --> 01:25:39.130
What of the pennies and nickels and dimes

01:25:39.130 --> 01:25:41.090
stolen from the poor?

01:25:41.090 --> 01:25:43.670
Children's lunch money that goes into our slot machines,

01:25:43.670 --> 01:25:45.960
workman's rent that's bet on horses.

01:25:45.960 --> 01:25:47.360
How many children have gone hungry

01:25:47.360 --> 01:25:49.150
and without food because of us?

01:25:49.150 --> 01:25:50.810
- Don't be a philosopher, Langley.

01:25:50.810 --> 01:25:53.650
Be funny, make 'em laugh.

01:25:53.650 --> 01:25:57.460
- My client, my client is a drunkard.

01:26:00.000 --> 01:26:04.240
to be a lawyer to defend the innocent and punish the guilty.

01:26:04.240 --> 01:26:05.900
- Make him laugh, Langley.

01:26:05.900 --> 01:26:07.560
