01:26:07.560 --> 01:26:09.560
- I'm telling you, watch the talk.

01:26:09.560 --> 01:26:11.320
- Who broke his faith and his will to refuse?

01:26:11.320 --> 01:26:13.320
- Either talk my way or shut up.

01:26:13.320 --> 01:26:15.320
- Who gave him a drink to forget what he did?

01:26:15.320 --> 01:26:17.090
- All right, so forget it.

01:26:17.090 --> 01:26:19.900
You're no lawyer, you're a clown, a drunken clown.

01:26:19.900 --> 01:26:20.710
Make him laugh.

01:26:20.710 --> 01:26:22.830
- My client was a child once with great

01:26:22.830 --> 01:26:24.770
and many hopes for the future.

01:26:24.770 --> 01:26:28.930
I can't help thinking, where are the killers?

01:26:30.990 --> 01:26:34.630
I killed him. I killed him. I told you I killed him.

01:26:34.630 --> 01:26:36.630
Punish me. I want to be punished.

01:26:36.630 --> 01:26:38.550
He wants to be punished.

01:26:38.550 --> 01:26:40.600
He wants to be punished.

01:26:40.600 --> 01:26:41.840
Get it over with.

01:26:41.840 --> 01:26:43.840
Let's get it over with. Why not?

01:26:43.840 --> 01:26:44.840
Life's too much for him.

01:26:44.840 --> 01:26:45.840
No.

01:26:45.840 --> 01:26:46.840
He can't understand it.

01:26:46.840 --> 01:26:47.840
No, no.

01:26:47.840 --> 01:26:48.840
Well, we can't understand it.

01:26:48.840 --> 01:26:50.840
Let's get it over with.

01:26:50.840 --> 01:26:51.820
Let's get it over with.

01:26:51.820 --> 01:26:53.680
So I can have a drink.

01:27:06.520 --> 01:27:14.060
- That's why it needs me.

01:27:14.060 --> 01:27:17.180
- Murder rap after all, couldn't it, boss?

01:27:17.180 --> 01:27:20.090
- He was a good man.

01:27:20.090 --> 01:27:23.750
He's been punished, now it's my turn.

01:27:23.750 --> 01:27:25.730
- No, no, you've got the wrong man.

01:27:25.730 --> 01:27:30.000
No, no, wrong, it's wrong, wrong, wrong!
